                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Eddy.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-12-15"><hi rendition="#italic">December 15,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay requests to be informed of the time limit within which appeals to the
                    admiralty court must be taken by American claimants in seizure cases.)</p>
            </div>
